#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:5
#: 96ca9b44d92c416eace511e7badc9c03
msgid "GPS Blending (aka Dual GPS)"
msgstr "GPS 融合（又称双 GPS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:7
#: 841b4c93445042e0820186135088cfbe
msgid ""
"GPS Blending combines the readings from two gpses. Using two GPSes reduces "
"the chance of glitches affecting the vehicle."
msgstr "GPS 融合将两个 GPS 的读数合并。使用两个 GPS 降低了毛刺影响飞行器的概率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:13
#: 7960e76e2f7143119e67cd210f11f2f6
msgid ""
"Only GPSs that report position and speed accuracy can be used for blending."
"  All UBlox GPSs provide this extra information while GPSs using the NMEA "
"protocol generally do not."
msgstr "只有报告位置和速度精度的 GPS 才能用于融合。所有 UBlox GPS 提供此额外信息，而使用 NMEA 协议的 GPS 通常不提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:15
#: 0c641391b6a648e0b0915a5c716c45a7
msgid ""
"Normally blending should be done with two GPSs from the same manufacturer "
"because the scaling of the accuracy numbers varies and will lead to "
"favouring one GPS over the other."
msgstr "通常应使用来自同一制造商的两个 GPS 进行融合，因为精度数字的缩放比例不同，会导致偏向某个 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:18
#: 73bf01e4b15e48efb209cb529b0308c0
msgid "Setup through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:20
#: 01e01389bac642b9b35d4202865a455a
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 5 / \"GPS\".  Alternatively "
"telemetry port 1 or 2 can be used by setting :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` or :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to 5."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 5 /「GPS」。或者，可以通过将 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 或 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 5 来使用数传端口 1 或 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:21
#: a3cab1394b0c47a285ccb3b524de4ec0
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS2_TYPE <GPS2_TYPE>` = 1 / \"AUTO\" or the specific number "
"corresponding to the type of GPS"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS2_TYPE <GPS2_TYPE>` = 1 /「AUTO」或与 GPS 类型对应的具体编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:22
#: 7d025502d1e242c1ac066f3c02029b84
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>` = 2 / \"Blend\".  Alternatively set"
" to 1 / \"UseBest\" to only use the better GPS.  The better GPS is decided "
"based on the GPS's self reported accuracy."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>` = 2 /「Blend」。或者设置为 1 "
"/「UseBest」以只使用较好的 GPS。根据 GPS 自报精度确定较好的 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:24
#: 7d26f2c8618e4d4cb57d4e6c5cc40678
msgid ""
"After rebooting the board, the status, hdop and satellite count of both GPSs"
" should be visible."
msgstr "重启飞控板后，应能看到两个 GPS 的状态、HDOP 和卫星计数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:30
#: 4c18cff95cbf4da5a1e9260e2e7c2062
msgid "Dataflash logging"
msgstr "数据闪存日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:32
#: 82cc8a89fa6a409ebd1bbf191e627e01
msgid ""
"The first GPS's data appears with an instance number of 0 in the GPS and GPA"
" messages. (ie GPS[0].x, GPA[0].x messages) The second GPS's data appears "
"with an instance number of 1 in the GPS and GPA messages. The blended GPS "
"data appears with an instance number of 2 in the GPS and GPA messages."
msgstr ""
"第一个 GPS 的数据在 GPS 和 GPA 消息中以实例编号 0 出现（即 GPS[0].x、GPA[0].x 消息）。第二个 GPS 的数据在 "
"GPS 和 GPA 消息中以实例编号 1 出现。融合的 GPS 数据在 GPS 和 GPA 消息中以实例编号 2 出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:36
#: 435f7b0e4ae3400fb203c20259ee52a3
msgid ""
"If using the Mission Planner, opening a dataflash log and clicking on \"Show"
" Map\" will show both GPSs, the blended position and the EKF's final "
"estimate (shown as \"POS\")"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Mission Planner，打开数据闪存日志并点击「Show Map」将显示两个 GPS、融合位置和 EKF 最终估计（显示为「POS」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:42
#: 65b61a9d36f6441698038ae887b9482a
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-blending.rst:44
#: e70d618340764803a37d14205ab81527
msgid ""
"Video of a heavily loaded IRIS using Blended GPS, optical flow and a lidar "
"range finder"
msgstr "重载 IRIS 使用融合 GPS、光流和激光雷达测距仪的视频"
